  See also:
    - :attr:`jax.numpy.ndarray.at`: take values via indexing syntax.
    - :func:`jax.numpy.take`: take the same indices along every axis slice.

  Examples:
    >>> x = jnp.array([[1., 2., 3.],
    ...                [4., 5., 6.]])
